  Category: 2
  Prefab: {fileID: 6625514644646704096, guid: 1f6a6789373206e498f996cb54aeedb1, type: 3}
  Interactable: {fileID: 5048261325816738630, guid: 1f6a6789373206e498f996cb54aeedb1, type: 3}
  TextFields:
  - 
  - "Astrid\u2014\n\nSo glad you left your aunt\u2019s place! It was time. You've
    been helping her for so long. I hope she at least said thank you. \n\nAbout your
    story idea\u2026 your instincts are right. This meteor storm could create mass
    panic. But my editor won\u2019t run it without more info. We need the when and
    where. And we need evidence. Not just Elijah\u2019s gut feeling.\n\nSorry. Wish
    I had better news. Next month's paper goes to print on October 1st. If you get
    more details, write us back. Or, you know, write back anyway. \n\nYour penpal,\nJocelyn"
  - "\nP.S. I love the work you and Elijah are doing. Charting the stars, telling
    stories about the sky instead of hiding from it\u2014it's so subversive. I could
    see this being a regular column. I\u2019d have to run it by my editor\u2026 but
    would you ever want a job here? "
